{"id":"5c5452002ba29fda","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-morphism.md","title":"Definition — Morphism and hom-set","display":"Definition — Morphism and hom-set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-morphism","aliases":["14-df-morphism"],"display":"Definition — Morphism and hom-set","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Morphism and hom-set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>。范畴数据及宇宙见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries。箭头带着来源与目标，且这里的 Hom 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中的集合；若需其属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，须另有局部小性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)$；$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$。范畴数据及宇宙见 [[14-df-category]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":854,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism|Definition — Morphism and hom-set]]"},{"id":"1c7cd3fb1e4b272e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d70b287bd93237ef","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]"},{"id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d1900a6f3b1135c9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是本书的 $\\mathcal V$-范畴。$\\mathrm{Ob}$、$\\mathrm{Hom}$ 见 [[14-df-category]]、[[14-df-morphism]]，$\\mathrm{IsMono}$ 见 [[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]，均在已绑定的 $\\mathcal C$ 中解释。$K,S,B$ 为对象，$m:S\\to B$、$f:S\\to K$ 为箭头；$\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathcal C}$、$\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal C}$、$\\operatorname{EnoughInj}$ 是下式定义。"},{"id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的范畴，$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)$。Hom 见 [[14-df-morphism]]。$\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C}$ 是箭头同构谓词，$\\mathrm{IsObjectIso}_{\\mathcal C}$ 是对象同构谓词；仅在环境范畴已固定时省略下标。$A\\cong B$ 仅在同一环境中缩写 $A\\cong_{\\mathcal C}B$。"},{"id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)$ (morphism, see [[14-df-morphism]])"},{"id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}$ (hom-set operation, see [[14-df-morphism]])"},{"id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)$ (morphism, see [[14-df-morphism]])"},{"id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,G:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 为函子（[[14-df-functor]]）。候选自然变换 $\\eta$ 为带来源/目标的三元组 $(F,G,\\alpha)$；当该三元组成立时，$\\eta_A$ 表示第三分量 $\\alpha(A)$。范畴及 Hom 见 [[14-df-morphism]]。"},{"id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"31aff49e22ab64ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C',C)$ (morphism, see [[14-df-morphism]])"},{"id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}$ (hom-set operation, see [[14-df-morphism]])"},{"id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]"},{"id":"0f4ff76187675015","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴，$B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$。Hom、单态射、同构分别见 [[14-df-morphism]]、[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]、[[14-df-isomorphism]]。$M_B$ 是下式给出的单态射集合；$\\sim_B$ 的定义域为 $M_B\\times M_B$，$[m]_{\\sim_B}$ 是其等价类。"},{"id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴；$T,A,B,P$ 是候选对象，$p,q$ 为候选箭头。Hom 见 [[14-df-morphism]]。"},{"id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism|Definition — Morphism and hom-set]]"},{"id":"3c6d89bc622365e0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a26eef9f2574e2f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0a4c2d07a1af86cb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}